if DAC_TLV320AIC3204

    config TLV320AIC3204_I2C_ADDR
        hex "AIC3204 I2C address (7-bit)"
        default 0x18
        help
            AIC3204 I2C address on the HA Voice PE is 0x18 (confirmed by the
            existing ESPHome aic3204 component that uses this bus at the same
            address). Override only if you know your wiring differs.

    config TLV320AIC3204_SAMPLE_RATE
        int "Audio sample rate"
        default 44100
        help
            Default I2S sample rate for the DAC. AirPlay sources negotiate,
            but the DAC config is pinned to this rate at init.

    config TLV320AIC3204_MAX_VOLUME_DB
        int "Maximum DAC volume (dB) at AirPlay 0 dB"
        range -100 0
        default -6
        help
            Volume the DAC applies when AirPlay reports 0 dB (max). AIC3204
            DAC digital volume registers (page 0, regs 65/66) go from +24 dB
            down to -63.5 dB in 0.5 dB steps; hardware volume beats software
            scaling for SNR, which is why we cap the codec side here and let
            the encoder / AirPlay set an attenuation below this ceiling.

endif
